Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 02:22:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix fusion transfer verifier key prefix; extend map-loading
 forensics

_verify_fusion_transfer compared model-level keys against the submodule
state_dict and always raised. Use the model state_dict filtered by the
graph_map_attention prefix.

check_pretrained_map_loading.py now runs each stage independently and
reports whether the pretrained fusion and map encoder were ever trained:
fusion tensor norms against the HF N(0,0.02) re-init scale (which also
overrides the zero-init in __init__), exactly-zero biases, and the map
encoder's category projection against its deterministic CLIP init.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xm3S8jGTjU1YqXnUPuWMgH
